# Go architecture

```
cmd/permitdenied/main.go   # window title, RunGame only
cmd/genbuildings/          # regenerate buildings.png
internal/game/             # play loop, input, sim, const.go
internal/dozer lot run threats fx audio render
assets/embed.go            # go:embed usable/*
```

No `pkg/`. No interfaces-for-one-implementation. No campaign packages in the compile graph. No goroutines — the sim is single-threaded in `Update`.

Geometry is Go literals in `lot/lot.go` (three structures). No JSON level schemas.

`Update` is logic. `Draw` is render. Never mutate sim state in `Draw`. Tunables live in `internal/game/const.go`.

Verify: `go test ./...` then `go run ./cmd/permitdenied`. Local package: `build.bat` → `dist\permitdenied.exe` (do not commit).
